---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#BB2528'
    primaryTextColor: '#ffffff'
    primaryBorderColor: '#7C0000'
    lineColor: '#F8B229'
    secondaryColor: '#006100'
    tertiaryColor: '#fff4dd'
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Mobile
    participant D as Desktop
    actor U as User
    U->>M: Open chat
    M->>D: POST /api/mobile/diagrams/render
    activate D
    D-->>M: JPEG image
    deactivate D
    Note right of D: cached for reuse
    alt syntax error
        D--xM: 422
    else ok
        M-)U: Show diagram
    end
    loop every message
        M->>M: Split mermaid blocks
    end
